# AME Bazaar — Autonomous Fashion Blog & Content Marketing Agent

## Purpose
This repository is the dedicated home for the AME Bazaar Fashion Content Marketing Agent. The implementation was originally developed inside `Yashu-maheshwari/ame-bazaar-ai-os` and is being separated here so the agent can be recovered, understood, tested, and extended without depending on chat history.

## Business Context
- Brand: AME Bazaar
- Business: family garments retail
- Primary market: Kirari, Delhi
- Website: https://amebazaar.in
- Goal: useful fashion/local-shopping content that improves SEO, AI discoverability, customer trust, store visits and product conversions.

## Production Engine
Main file: `scripts/fashion_content_agent.js`

Pipeline:
1. Load `config/local.env`.
2. Load centralized facts from `config/business_config.json`.
3. Read topic queue and duplicate-protection memory.
4. Generate new topics with Gemini when the queue is empty.
5. Generate article + campaign assets with Gemini.
6. Add AME Bazaar CTA and relevant WooCommerce products.
7. Run SEO Quality Gate.
8. Run production data-integrity checks.
9. Generate featured image using OpenAI when configured, otherwise Unsplash fallback.
10. Upload image to WordPress.
11. Add Article + FAQ JSON-LD.
12. Save campaign assets under `projects/content-marketing/<slug>/`.
13. Create a WordPress draft through REST API.
14. Attempt Google Business Profile local-post publishing.
15. Update daily execution history and published-topic memory.

## CLI
```text
node scripts/fashion_content_agent.js
node scripts/fashion_content_agent.js --dry-run
node scripts/fashion_content_agent.js --verbose
node scripts/fashion_content_agent.js --force-topic "Topic title"
```

